<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23586" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-nŭo</span></b> , ŭi,
			ūtum, 3, v. n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to give a nod</i>, <i>to nod to; to give a sign</i>, <i>to
			intimate</i>, <i>hint.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b> With <i>dat.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ubi ego innuero vobis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Rud. 3, 4, 26</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">abiens innuit mihi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Eun. 4, 5, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stabat innuebat digito similis vocanti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Ep. 7, 27, 9</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ne mora sit, si innuerim, quin pugnus in mala
					haereat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Ad. 2, 1, 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ubi innuerint,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					8, 4, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coram licet innuat atque Rescribat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					6, 140</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aqua innuetur his signis esse tenus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr. 8,
					5</span></i>
			
			<i>ext.</i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To mean</i>, <i>intimate</i>, <i>signify</i>, = significo, Don. ad <i><span class="en">Ter. Ad. 2,
				1, 46</span></i>.</div>
